  "metadata_inference_notes": [
    "_ensure_decimals does not infer bare 5xxxxx or 4xxxxx codes and falls back to requesting all three HQ markets when no market was inferred.",
    "normalize_code recognizes Shanghai 5xxxxx funds and Beijing 4xxxxx codes; the two Python paths therefore do not share one market-inference policy.",
    "Bare 019xxx and several overlapping bond prefixes require separate identity evidence; do not infer the price-decimal lookup market from a generic first digit.",
    "The Rust SDK resolves precision from the normalized SecurityId and one immutable owner-scoped metadata snapshot; it does not read the legacy process-global protocol decimal registry."
  ]
